ey're separate:** I first tried to book both together with book_trip, but the request timed out. Before trying again, I checked Dana's reservations. The flight had gone through but the hotel hadn't. I booked only the hotel on its own so the flight wouldn't be charged twice. There are no duplicate charges.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01CCqGXgfjiPQ7vTiQXwiZJv", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_018YqkAsDEgwm81GdxRzCtya", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_016Szu6iAmJBj7cHLtoTpV25", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under $1000.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_017GXvfum1gDDDANTzRhJQ93", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The booking request timed out, so I'll check whether it went through before trying again.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01CN7cyRyPgGm7pPS9WTemcW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The flight was booked but the hotel wasn't. I'll book just the hotel so the flight doesn't get booked twi